\par\par \b \uc2 SOFTS HIGHLIGHTS: Top Stories Of The Day\b0\par\par\uc2 192 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 August 2012\par 11:48\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global News Select\par \uc2 DJON\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    COCOA \par  \par Cocoa Research Institute of Nigeria Workers on Strike - Staff Member \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 IBADAN, Nigeria--Research and other activities have ground to a halt at the state-run Cocoa Research Institute of Nigeria, or CRIN, due to a strike by its workers, a staff member at the institute said Tuesday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    COFFEE \par  \par Mexico's July Coffee Exports up 27% on Year to 327,457 Bags \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MEXICO CITY--Mexico's coffee exports in July totaled 327,457 bags of 60 kilograms each, up 27% from the same month last year, the Mexican Coffee Association, Amecafe, said Tuesday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Colombian Coffee Growers Demand Stronger \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 MANIZALES, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Colombia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 --\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Colombia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's coffee sector Tuesday joined a chorus of critics of the country's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  who feel the institution isn't doing enough to prevent excessive strength in the peso.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Vietnam July Coffee Exports Down 18.8% on Month at 114,000 Tons -Customs \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 HANOI--Vietnam exported 114,000 metric tons of coffee in July, a decline of 18.8% from June but more than double the amount in July 2011, the Customs Department said Wednesday. [ 08-15-12 0548ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 48101 83714   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJON000020120815e88f0001y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
