\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  Finance Minister Wants 'Aggressive'  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  -Report\b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Juni 2012\par 13:55\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Finance Minister Juan Carlos Echeverry is calling for more aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to prevent further gains in the peso against the dollar, Reuters reported.\par \par \uc2 "I maintain it's necessary that in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  we have a more aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  with immediate sterilization," Echeverry told lawmakers during a debate on the peso Tuesday, according to the news agency.\par \par \uc2 The local market has been flooded with greenbacks due to record-breaking foreign investment in Colombia's oil sector, which has caused the peso to gain 9% against the dollar this year, making it one of the strongest \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the world. Colombia's peso ended Tuesday at COP1,779 for a dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  already buys at least $20 million a day in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in an attempt to mop up excess greenbacks and stem the peso's gains, but Echeverry said that is not enough.\par \par \uc2 "The exchange rate remains a worrying variable. I've asked the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board to look at what other similar economies are doing like Peru. We can learn from them if one can have controlled inflation and a more aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said.\par \par \uc2 Officials at the Finance Ministry weren't immediately available for comment.\par \par \uc2 Echeverry, who as finance minister is also one of the seven voting members of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board, has urged his fellow board members for more aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times in recent months. He quieted down in May when the peso weakened 4% due to worries over Europe's debt crisis. But in June the peso has rebounded, and is once again nearing its strongest levels of the year.\par \par \uc2 -Write to Dan Molinski at dan.molinski@dowjones.com [ 13-06-12 1155GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120613e86d000rr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
