\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  finmin favors more peso  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  -IFR\b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Mai 2012\par 20:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BOGOTA, May 24 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Finance Minister Juan Carlos Echeverry reiterated that he supports more \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to have a competitive exchange rate, IFR, a Thomson Reuters news service, reported on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The Colombian peso has strengthened 5.0 percent against the U.S. dollar so far this year. The peso gains have slowed in recent weeks after reaching 9.7 percent in early May.\par \par \uc2 "I'm of the conviction that we can do a better job with the exchange rate," Echeverry told IFR in an interview on the sidelines of the Colombia Inside Out conference in New York this week.\par \par \uc2 "In general I think we could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  more. It's crucial to have a competitive exchange rate."\par \par \uc2 At its last meeting in April, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  voted to extend for another three months its dollar purchase program aimed at putting a brake on peso appreciation. The bank will buy at least $20 million a day on the spot market until Nov. 2.\par \par \uc2 Echeverry said he believed in a floating rate but that he is concerned that export revenues are being affected.\par \par \uc2 "As long as the U.S. maintains an expansionist monetary policy, it will continue to be a difficult situation for exporters from other countries, not just Colombia," he said.\par \par \uc2 (Writing by Eduardo Garcia; Editing by James Dalgleish)\par \par \uc2 COLOMBIA-PESO/ | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | NAT | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120524e85o001am\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
