\par\par \b \uc2 Colombia's Peso At 1-Month High Ahead Of  \highlight22\uc2 Central-Bank \highlight\uc2  Meeting\b0\par\par\uc2 241 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 April 2012\par 17:26\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--The Colombian peso gained Friday to a one-month high, a move that increases the odds \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Colombia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  might disclose new \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  measures Monday to reverse the peso's strengthening trend.\f28 \par \par \uc2 The peso is 9% stronger against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year as the local market has been flooded with dollars due to record levels of foreign direct investment in Colombia's booming oil and coal sectors.\par \par \uc2 Friday morning in Bogota, the peso traded at COP1,758.51 for a dollar, its strongest level since late March.\par \par \uc2 Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  holds its monthly monetary-policy meeting Monday, and some observers said they think the bank may announce afterward that it is increasing the $20 million it buys daily in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to remove excess dollars.\par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Juan Carlos Echeverry, who is also one of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's seven board members, has been publicly calling for more-aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , saying the peso's current level makes it impossible for the country's exporters to be competitive abroad.\par \par \uc2 But other members of the board, including bank President Jose Dario Uribe, have consistently argued against "too much" \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, saying it could lead to other problems including inflation.\par \par \uc2 -By Dan Molinski, Dow Jones Newswires; 57-310-867-6542; dan.molinski@dowjones.com [ 27-04-12 1526GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120427e84r001nx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
