\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  Peso Nears COP1,800 To Dollar On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Talk\b0\par\par\uc2 323 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2012\par 15:17\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso weakened Friday toward levels unseen in two months amid persistent verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by Finance Minister Juan Carlos Echeverry.\par \par \uc2 The peso was recently trading at COP1,797, 0.2% lower from Thursday's close and just a few ticks away from the psychologically important COP1,800 level, which it hasn't reached since the beginning of February.\par \par \uc2 Colombia's exporters have been hurt by the peso's 9% rise against the dollar so far this year. In an effort to stem further gains, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buys $20 million daily in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to mop up excess U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But Echeverry said in published reports Monday the government is "now in favor of a more intense, more aggressive" \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . And speaking Thursday night to Colombian lawmakers in downtown Bogota, Echeverry repeated the same mantra.\par \par \uc2 Analysts have previously predicted the bank might wait until the peso strengthens toward COP1,750 for a dollar before enacting more severe \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But they say Echeverry's recent comments suggest authorities are trying to establish a new line in the sand at around COP1,800, on the argument that exporters can't be competitive at COP1,750.\par \par \uc2 Since Echeverry's initial comments were published Monday, the peso is nearly 2% weaker. If the trend continues, the verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  alone might do the trick, rending more aggressive, actual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  unnecessary.\par \par \uc2 However, if the peso regains its strengthening trend, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  seems likely.\par \par \uc2 "While the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will likely first undertake a more aggressive reserve accumulation strategy," the Eurasia Group said in a research note. "The [President Juan Manuel] Santos administration could very well push for additional measures, such as capital controls, in order to contain growing political pressures from exporters."\par \par \uc2 --By Dan Molinski, Dow Jones Newswires; 57-310-867-6542; dan.molinski@dowjones.com [ 30-03-12 1351GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120330e83u0011p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
