\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging-Market Investors Faced With Fewer 'Carry'  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 640 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2012\par 21:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  limit carry-trade options\par \par \uc2 --Investors continue to seek higher-yielding paper\par \par \uc2 --Focus turns to Mexican peso and South African rand\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Prabha Natarajan \par    Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--Investors remain bullish on emerging-market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and now that Greece has concluded its debt restructuring, low volatility in global markets offers an ideal time to initiate trades.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The problem, however, is these investors' options are less plentiful now that central banks in emerging markets have built walls to protect their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 One favorite play, selling the dollar and buying Brazilian real assets, lost its luster recently after a rash of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central-bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  actions to prevent further appreciation of the Brazilian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . Central banks in Turkey, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Colombia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and Peru also have \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  either directly or indirectly to stop their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from rising too quickly.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The genesis of this "\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  war" is the rapid gains among emerging-market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the first two months of the year. Investors, especially those in developed countries like the U.S. and U.K. with a capacity to borrow cash at ultra-low yields, sought out assets in emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  that also offered the added bonus of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  appreciation. This so-called carry trade resulted in emerging-market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  gaining 5% to 10% in the first six weeks of the year.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Earlier this year, a broad basket of emerging-market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  including the real, Turkish lira, Indian rupee, and Indonesian rupiah were viewed as the best carry \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . The purchases were funded either through the dollar or euro.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Now that central banks in many of these countries are resisting, investors are hesitant to go for the same play. After all, no one wants to bet against the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . Rather, they are keen on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  like the rand and Mexican peso, whose central banks don't \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on a daily basis in the market. Both also offer higher interest rates on local bonds.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "That story of broad risk-on, risk-off way of looking at \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is changing," said Guillermo Felices, head of European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategy at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Barclays Capital\f28 \uc2 \f2 . "Investors have to be much more discerning in the way one picks carry. Lazy carry will be penalized."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Central banks' protectionism, of course, isn't expected to end carry trades based on the wide yield differentials. Over the medium to long term, emerging-market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  are expected to gain against the dollar and other developed-world \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . And as central banks in the U.S., Europe and Japan keep interest rates low and continue with their quantitative-easing policies, investors will be on the lookout for higher-yielding paper.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "There's a competitive nature to this game," said Stephen Jen, partner at SLJ Macro Partners, an investment company that also manages a hedge fund. "Money will go to places where capital flows are welcome, where policy makers are more tolerant."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For many investors that place is Mexico. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has gained 10.2% this year, and its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  hasn't indicated any shift in policy to curb the appreciation. And Mexico's close trade links with the U.S. make it an automatic beneficiary of a recovery here.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In addition, Thanasis Petronikolos, head of emerging-market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and debt at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Baring Asset Management\f28 \uc2 \f2 , sees opportunities in dollar-denominated bonds of Chinese companies and so-called dim sum bonds, which are listed in Hong Kong but denominated in Chinese yuan.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 But he doesn't recommend backing out of Brazil or Hungary, especially if investors got in early.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The fundamental story on the strength of the real is still there," he said. "With high-yielding local bonds, investors should be ready to cope with short-term volatility."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Prabha Natarajan, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \uc2 \f2 ; 212-416-2468; prabha.natarajan@dowjones.com [ 03-13-12 1633ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020120313e83d000ut\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
