\par\par \b \uc2 Colombia's Santos says govt to take peso measures\b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Oktober 2010\par 21:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2 * Govt under pressure to do more to halt firming peso\par \par \uc2 * Cenbank board to hold monthly policy meeting on Friday\par \par \uc2 BOGOTA, Oct 23 (Reuters) - Colombian President Juan Manuel Santos said on Saturday that the government would announce measures in the coming week to help mitigate the impact of the rising peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <COP=RR>.\par \par \uc2 Latin America's No. 4 oil producer has seen its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthen due to inflows into its mining and energy sectors, dollar sales to finance government spending and a recovery from the global financial crisis.\par \par \uc2 "In the coming week we're going to take measures that we've studied well ... take measures that really have an impact on this quite complicated situation," Santos said.\par \par \uc2 Santos did not give any details.\par \par \uc2 (For a scenarios on possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures, click [ID:nN15183902])\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  started a dollar purchasing program in mid-September to try to control the peso's rise. The government has also tried to improve business competitiveness and bring fewer dollars into the nation.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will hold its monthly monetary policy meeting on Friday, and analysts said action could be taken then on the peso.\par \par \uc2 The country's government and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  have been under pressure from companies and unions to do more to stop the appreciating peso, which has hurt exporters' profits. (Reporting by Luis Jaime Acosta; editing by Jim Marshall)\par \par \uc2 COLOMBIA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|ABN|E|U|RBN|M|D|C|GRO|MTL|SOF|RNP|DNP|PCM    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101023e6an000ed\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
