\par\par \b \uc2 Colombia firms ask govt for more  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  measures\b0\par\par\uc2 402 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Oktober 2010\par 17:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Powerful body wants more measures against rising peso\par \par \uc2 * Group asks cenbank to lower key interest rate\par \par \uc2 BOGOTA, Oct 11 (Reuters) - Colombian companies asked the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday to accelerate dollar purchases to help contain the rising peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , saying the authority could buy nearly $10 billion more, a powerful unions group said.\par \par \uc2 Colombia's local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <COP=RR> has surged nearly 13 percent so far this year in a region where high commodities' prices and strong growth has attracted a slew of investors, increasing capital inflows that strengthens local \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and finance ministry could evaluate the best way to obtain additional reserves, an amount that could be $35 billion, equivalent to 11.7 months of imports or 14 percent of GDP," said the National Union Council, a grouping of unions of industry, exporters, agriculture producers and others.\par \par \uc2 Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- where international reserves are currently around $26 billion or 9 months of import cover -- began a dollar purchasing program in mid-September of at least $20 million daily. [ID:nN15145483]\par \par \uc2 <^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Colombia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2           [ID:nN24243857]\par  Latin American interest rates          [ID:nN08199099]\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Comments by policymakers on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  [ID:nSGE695036]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Global \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  war report: \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://r.reuters.com/dyw27p"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://r.reuters.com/dyw27p}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^>\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Some emerging governments have moved to stem the rise of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to stop their economies overheating and defend their exporters, sparking talk of a brewing "\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  war."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The World Bank said Latin American governments should moderate fiscal spending to help central banks tame rapidly appreciating \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . Authorities in Colombia, Brazil and Peru have moved to curb their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . [ID:nN24260311]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Colombian Finance Minister Juan Carlos Echeverry said last week the Andean nation would consider allowing multinational companies to pay some taxes offshore to reduce the flow of dollars into the country. [ID:nN08222874]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The union grouping said in an open letter to the government that dollar inflows from the top state-run companies should be controlled and asked the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to reduce its benchmark interest rate from historic lows of 3 percent.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The velocity with which the peso has appreciated and the depth of the revaluation has arrived at a point where it puts at risk the positive horizon of Colombia's economy," the union said. (Reporting by Javier Mozzo; Writing by Jack Kimball; Editing by Andrew Hay)\f28 \par \par \uc2 COLOMBIA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101011e6ab0014m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
