\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Colombia, Peru  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2  hit 2-year highs\b0\par\par\uc2 518 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 September 2010\par 16:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Colombia's peso, Peru's sol touch new two-year highs\par \par \uc2 * Brazil's real at 2010 high after China data\par \par \uc2 * Mexican peso gains more modest 0.5 pct (Adds details, Colombia peso, commentary; changes dateline)\par \par \uc2 By Caroline Stauffer and Nelson Bocanegra\par \par \uc2 MEXICO CITY/BOGOTA, Sept 13 (Reuters) - Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  posted sharp gains on Monday, boosted by better-than-expected factory data from China, new global banking rules and increasing risk appetite.\par \par \uc2 "Fundamental factors are aligning for equity market strength and that's helping risk sentiment for Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Vassili Serebriakov, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 Wells Fargo\uc2  in New York.\par \par \uc2 Colombia's peso reached a new two-year high of 1,791.3 per dollar as traders said government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's appreciation looked less likely.\par \par \uc2 "People are increasingly more aware of the limited space the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Diego Camacho, chief economist at brokerage Acciones de \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Bogota.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso traded at its strongest in eight months on Monday, bidding at 494.5 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 The country's economy has recovered much faster than expected from the effects of a devastating earthquake in February, pushing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to raise interest rates to curb inflation.\par \par \uc2 Economists widely expect the bank to raise its benchmark rate by 50 basis points to 2.50 percent at its Sept. 16 policy meeting.\par \par \uc2 "Latin America is considered a commodity export region and any possibility that commodity prices will remain strong is beneficial for Latin America's \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Pedro Tuesta, senior Latin America economist at 4Cast.\par \par \uc2 The Peruvian sol <PEN=PE> also hit a fresh two-year high on Monday, gaining 0.36 percent to 2.7880 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Peru may be forced to slow its pace of interest rate hikes, despite rampant growth, for fear of fueling the recent rally of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  economist Daniel Volberg. [ID:nN13202817]\par \par \uc2 MEXICAN PESO TRAILS BEHIND\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real <BRBY> strengthened for the ninth straight day on Monday to its strongest level since Dec. 4 2009, gaining 0.23 percent to 1.714 reais per U.S. dollar on the local spot market.\par \par \uc2 China overtook the United States last year to become Brazil's main trading partner. Mexico, Latin America's second largest economy, on the other hand sends roughly 80 percent of its exports to the United States.\par \par \uc2 Mexico's peso <MXN=> strengthened 0.47 percent on Monday to 12.8778 per dollar, retreating slightly from gains made earlier in the session.\par \par \uc2 The peso posted its best performance in three weeks but failed to break monthly records like its regional counterparts.\par \par \uc2 "There have been some question marks over Mexico compared to say Chile, which has been exceptionally strong," Serebriakov in New York said. "Concerns over the U.S. slowdown have weighed on Mexico and its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been underperforming somewhat." (Additional reporting by Samantha Pearson in Sao Paulo and Ursula Scollo in Lima, Editing by Chizu Nomiyama)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100916e69d0014k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
