e peso are not likely to see any movement from the bank's rate decision on Friday. However, the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will likely move whether or not the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announces measures to control the peso since the market is expecting some sort of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 COLOMBIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -RATES/ (PREVIEW)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|RNP    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100818e68i00103\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
