\par\par \b \uc2 Colombia may restart dlr buys to crimp peso-experts\b0\par\par\uc2 559 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Juli 2010\par 21:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Foreign investment keeps upward pressure on local peso\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  nears highest point since October\par \par \uc2 By Nelson Bocanegra\par \par \uc2 BOGOTA, July 6 (Reuters) - Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may restart buying U.S. dollars sooner rather than later to put the breaks on a strengthening peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that has neared its highest point in nine months, analysts said on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Strong foreign direct investment has seen the peso <COP=RR> firm nearly 10 percent over the last 12 months, and the rise has sparked an outcry from exporters who pay their costs in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but receive greenbacks from sales.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Jose Dario Uribe said last week that the entity would not renew its program to purchase $20 million a day after June 30, but the monetary boss left the door open to resume purchases in the future. For details, see [ID:nLDE66014E]\par \par \uc2 With the peso so strong, experts say the moment is right for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to accumulate more international reserves, which reached highs of $26.4 billion at the end of June.\par \par \uc2 "They will buy due to exchange rate conditions and due to the announcement by the finance minister, and above all because of the conditions to accumulate international reserves," said Julian Cardenas, head of research at Corredores Asociados.\par \par \uc2 The peso neared its highest level since October on Tuesday in response to a finance ministry announcement last week that the government would borrow an additional $1 billion from foreign sources. [ID:nN02205834]\par \par \uc2 "We hope that the dollar buying mechanism is reactivated before any other (exchange rate) measures," said Camilo Perez, head of economic research at \uc2 Banco de Bogota\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The Andean nation said last month it expected investment in its oil and mining sectors to be $62 billion between 2008 and 2015, 24 percent higher than its previous estimate. [ID:nN21242394]\par \par \uc2 SPACE FOR APPRECIATION?\par \par \uc2 "It's a decision that depends in part on the velocity and magnitude of the appreciation. In my opinion, there's space for an appreciation of the peso before generating the need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Jimena Zuniga of \uc2 Barclays Capital\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has seen its economy rebound this year after falling due to the global economic crisis in 2009, and has upped its 2010 growth to 3 percent from a previous estimate of 2.5 percent. [ID:nN15262841]\par \par \uc2 A main challenge for President-elect Juan Manuel Santos -- who takes office in August -- will be to manage inflows of greenbacks into extractive sectors in Latin America's No. 4 oil producer and the world's fifth largest coal exporter.\par \par \uc2 Santos says he wants to create an overseas fund to help manage revenue from oil and mining.\par \par \uc2 In the past, governments have had to give subsidies to the export sector to avoid job cuts in a nation with one of the region's highest unemployment rates.\par \par \uc2 Exporters have called on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep buying the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt the peso's rise.\par \par \uc2 "It's fundamental to maintain the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at least for the rest of the year and increment it to avoid a major reassessment of the existing (rate)," said Augusto Solano, president of Colombia's flowers exporters association. (Writing by Jack Kimball; Editing by Andrea Ricci)\par \par \uc2 COLOMBIA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|C|D|E|M|O|U|MTL|GRO|SOF|OIL   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100709e676001ea\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
