\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  cenbank suspends  \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 132 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juni 2008\par 17:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BOGOTA, June 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it suspended its program of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , designed to control peso volatility, starting on Thursday and continuing through August 8.\par \par \uc2 The bank issued a statement on Thursday announcing the suspension, which followed its decision on Friday to buy $20 million per day in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in a bid to control the rise of the peso.\par \par \uc2 The announcement of the suspension of the anti-volatility \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program prompted selling of the peso, which sank 3.9 percent to 1,847 to the dollar, extending deep losses for the week. (Reporting by Nelson Bocanegra, writing by Hugh Bronstein; Editing by Jonathan Oatis)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 COLOMBIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|E|U|RBN|D|M|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080626e46q002bt\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (colombia near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw)and (centr